    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Manual setup required\n1. Create an HTTP Header Auth credential: `Authorization` = `Bearer YOUR_PRIVATE_INTEGRATION_TOKEN`.\n2. Select it in all four HighLevel HTTP Request nodes.\n3. Replace the five `YOUR_...` placeholders in **Normalize and Validate**.\n4. Required scopes: contacts.readonly, contacts.write, opportunities.readonly, opportunities.write.\n5. In HighLevel enable **Allow Multiple Opportunities per Contact**.\n\nWebhook requires: externalLeadId, serviceInterest, name (or firstName/lastName), and email or phone.",
